{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1800250/extras/c6c6c2e289ef00f096f1403b570bf39b.avif?t=1769061718\" width=564 height=185 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1800250/extras/52141cf18c83c6a0d1ffa6aca315ab82.poster.avif?t=1769061718\" width=1000 height=562 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1800250/extras/52141cf18c83c6a0d1ffa6aca315ab82.webm?t=1769061718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1800250/extras/52141cf18c83c6a0d1ffa6aca315ab82.mp4?t=1769061718\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped within the <strong>Abyssal Cube</strong>, an ever-shifting prison that defies reality, lost souls wander endlessly in search of release. You awaken as one of them, an immortal vessel haunted by echoes of a forgotten past, bound to a world that refuses to let you die.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each rebirth pulls you deeper into the prison\u2019s secrets. Faces blur between dream and memory, and unseen forces whisper of freedom just beyond reach. To break the cycle, you must face the nightmares that shaped this world and the truth that waits within yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>FEATURES:</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hybrid gameplay of shooter and Hack &amp; Slash</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1800250/extras/184a8cbd3cd8a0d72be6d6948a6a1a57.poster.avif?t=1769061718\" width=1000 height=562 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1800250/extras/184a8cbd3cd8a0d72be6d6948a6a1a57.webm?t=1769061718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1800250/extras/184a8cbd3cd8a0d72be6d6948a6a1a57.mp4?t=1769061718\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1800250/extras/e187ab3fecf67b071973f6b44381587d.poster.avif?t=1769061718\" width=600 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1800250/extras/e187ab3fecf67b071973f6b44381587d.webm?t=1769061718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1800250/extras/e187ab3fecf67b071973f6b44381587d.mp4?t=1769061718\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hack, Slash, and Shoot as One</strong>\u00a0Seamlessly blend melee combat and third-person gunplay in fast-paced, fluid battles. Switch between styles mid-fight to chain devastating combos and control the flow of combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Soul Energy System</strong>\u00a0Every bullet, blast, and sorcery consumes <i>Soul Energy</i>. To replenish it, you must dive back into melee\u00a0 striking foes with your Soul Weapon to draw power from their essence.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sorceries of Power</strong>\u00a0Unleash destructive abilities fueled by your stored energy\u00a0 from spectral barrages to reality warping curses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adapt to Survive</strong>\u00a0True mastery lies in balance: knowing when to strike up close, when to retreat and shoot, and when to unleash your stored fury.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every Fight Feeds the Next</strong>\u00a0Aggression isn\u2019t just encouraged it\u2019s survival. The more you fight, the stronger and deadlier you become.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1800250/extras/3ac20b2256abc387af6e00baa89088b6.avif?t=1769061718\" width=633 height=252 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adaptability:</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>50+ Firearms</strong>\u00a0Discover an arsenal ranging from precision rifles and rapid pistols to cursed launchers that reshape the battlefield. Each weapon offers unique stats and effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>30+ Sorceries</strong>\u00a0Command the void with devastating abilities summon spectral claws, ignite soul storms, or warp reality itself. Every sorcery changes how you fight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>20+ Spirits (Playstyles)</strong>\u00a0Spirits define your core identity each one alters movement, abilities, and stats, allowing for radically different playstyles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>20+ Soul Weapons</strong>\u00a0Harness melee weapons forged from pure essence each one carrying unique traits, movesets, and elemental affinities that feed your Soul Energy system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adaptive Styles</strong>\u00a0Manifestations of lost souls that shape your playstyle called Echoes. Each Echo grants unique abilities and passive traits, letting you tailor your combat approach from relentless melee pressure to agile evasion or ranged precision.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolve Every Run</strong>\u00a0Weapons, sorceries, and styles are randomized, ensuring no two runs feel the same. Adapt on the fly and craft your own path to survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master Adaptability</strong>\u00a0Every encounter pushes you to reforge your tactics and embrace the chaos becoming the embodiment of evolution itself.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1800250/extras/ab79d8011f31c8f412811a6b10d8f064.avif?t=1769061718\" width=629 height=234 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Bosses:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1800250/extras/702422da6d39f9188e8ef08cceca40d3.poster.avif?t=1769061718\" width=1000 height=562 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1800250/extras/702422da6d39f9188e8ef08cceca40d3.webm?t=1769061718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1800250/extras/702422da6d39f9188e8ef08cceca40d3.mp4?t=1769061718\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>30+ Intense Boss Battles</strong>\u00a0Every dungeon culminates in a unique, hand-crafted boss designed to test your skill, timing, and adaptability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>80+ Enemy Types</strong>\u00a0Encounter a diverse roster of foes, from corrupted souls to colossal monstrosities that evolve as you progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dungeon Finales that Hit Hard</strong>\u00a0Known as\u00a0<i>Guardians, they</i>\u00a0exist for one purpose. To return you to the void. They\u2019re ruthless, unpredictable, and demand mastery of everything you\u2019ve learned within the dungeon.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolve Before You Fall</strong>\u00a0Strengthen your build, discover lucid powers, and push your limits before stepping into the arena. </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1800250?t=1769061718","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1800250/13ba583ba00abd0e4edd37cd1c7de6bd3e2f643f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769061718","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1800250/19c7ed9d8163703ab9979e16c2186fbb150f86c5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769061718","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1800250/19c7ed9d8163703ab9979e16c2186fbb150f86c5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769061718","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1800250/extras/c6c6c2e289ef00f096f1403b570bf39b.avif?t=1769061718\" width=564 height=185 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1800250/extras/52141cf18c83c6a0d1ffa6aca315ab82.poster.avif?t=1769061718\" width=1000 height=562 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1800250/extras/52141cf18c83c6a0d1ffa6aca315ab82.webm?t=1769061718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1800250/extras/52141cf18c83c6a0d1ffa6aca315ab82.mp4?t=1769061718\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped within the <strong>Abyssal Cube</strong>, 